# React SPA Usage Guide
...
## Running the Application

1. Ensure you have Node.js installed (version 14 or higher recommended)
2. Navigate to the `react-spa` directory
3. Install dependencies:
   ```
   npm install
   ```
4. Start the development server:
   ```
   npm start
   ```
5. Open your browser and go to http://localhost:1234

## How to Use

1. When the application loads, you will see a form with an input field labeled "Enter Your Name:"
2. Type your name into the input field
3. Click the "Submit" button
4. A greeting message will appear below the form, displaying "Hello, [Your Name]!" and a welcome message

## Features

- Simple, clean UI
- Real-time name input
- Greeting message displays after form submission
- Responsive design that works on different screen sizes

